  "getting_there": {
    "by_pt_html": "<p><strong>Zahnradbahn</strong> to <strong>Rotenboden</strong>.</p>\n<p>Information about the cable car Zermatt - Rotenboden: https://www.gornergratbahn.ch/de/sommer/bahninformationen/</p>",
    "by_car_html": "<p>Zermatt is car-free. Drive to <strong>Täsch</strong> (A9 motorway via Visp), park at the Matterhorn Terminal, and take the shuttle train to Zermatt (~12 min). From Zermatt, take the <strong>Gornergrat Bahn</strong> to Rotenboden station (2815 m).</p>"
  },
